        <item>
            <title>1.5.1</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 13:02:02 +1100</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/MilkshakeSR/Lectern</link>
            <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Lectern 1.5.1</title>
<style>body{font:13px -apple-system,sans-serif;margin:16px;color:#222}h2{margin:0 0 4px}h3{margin:14px 0 4px;color:#7a5af0}
li{margin:3px 0}@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){body{color:#eee;background:#1e1e1e}}</style></head>
<body><h2>Lectern 1.5.1</h2><p>Flashcards work reliably with local models; drop highlight fixed</p><h3>Fixed</h3><ul><li>Making flashcards no longer fails with &quot;couldn&#x27;t be read&quot; when a local model writes slightly broken data. Lectern repairs the reply, keeps every card it can read and tries once more if needed. Quizzes benefit too.</li><li>Cards labelled fill-in-the-blank with no blank are now normal cards, so they come up for review.</li><li>Error messages no longer say &quot;Claude&quot; when you&#x27;re using Ollama.</li><li>Dragging a file over the notes bar highlights only the box it drops into.</li></ul></body></html>]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/MilkshakeSR/Lectern/releases/download/v1.5.1/Lectern.dmg" length="7589706" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="rrCYXOP+CvFAf8liSBALAeEO8Jz5VdAGjRXvrR+CHD4K2BrgxOHZjTBq7HoCD7QgjT40YxgMC5xBSs/JJl3iDQ=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>1.5.0</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:18:49 +1100</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/MilkshakeSR/Lectern</link>
            <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Lectern 1.5.0</title>
<style>body{font:13px -apple-system,sans-serif;margin:16px;color:#222}h2{margin:0 0 4px}h3{margin:14px 0 4px;color:#7a5af0}
li{margin:3px 0}@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){body{color:#eee;background:#1e1e1e}}</style></head>
<body><h2>Lectern 1.5.0</h2><p>See every file on a page, reorder pages, and click folders to open them</p><h3>Added</h3><ul><li>A Files button (paperclip) at the top right of every page lists all the files and links added to it. Click one to open it, or show it in Finder.</li><li>Change the order of pages, lectures, quizzes, decks and folders: drag them, or use ⋯ → Change Order (Move Up, Move Down, Move to Top, Move to Bottom).</li></ul><h3>Changed</h3><ul><li>Clicking anywhere on a folder in the sidebar opens or closes it, not just the arrow.</li><li>New pages, lectures, quizzes and decks go to the bottom of their folder instead of being sorted A–Z. Your existing order is kept.</li></ul></body></html>]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/MilkshakeSR/Lectern/releases/download/v1.5.0/Lectern.dmg" length="7582090" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="X6wUqoGLCipSb2HGoCIq3516aB+hka5aZ9MWb9rq0fp+QTLWrxeMWlXL15Gfjcf0M33/+K1gX3maxHTH2Xy5CQ=="/>
